      <h2>FAQ</h2>
      <h3>How many Shopify email apps does a store need?</h3>
      <p>Usually fewer than the marketplace suggests. Start with the system that owns the message and add a specialist only when it receives a signal or provides a workflow the primary system cannot safely handle.</p>
      <h3>Should every app be tested with a discount?</h3>
      <p>No. Use a randomized holdout or a justified matched comparison where possible. Vendor-attributed purchases do not establish causal incremental lift. Compare contribution after discounts and refunds with matched subscriptions, usage, integrations, migration, support and reply labor; do not assume an extra recovered cart pays for a platform.</p>
